---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';import data from '../../data/calendar.json';
export function getStaticPaths(){return data.decades.map((decade,index)=>({params:{slug:decade.slug},props:{decade,index}}))}
const {decade:d,index:i}=Astro.props;
---
<Base title={`${d.zh} · ${d.fr}`} description={d.text}><div class="container"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/time/">时间尺度</a> / 十日一旬</div><article class="month-hero"><div class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">LES JOURS DE LA DÉCADE</p><h1>{d.zh}<span lang="fr">{d.fr}</span></h1><p class="subtitle">词根：{d.root}</p></div><div class="decade-wheel" aria-label={`每旬第${i+1}日`}><strong>{i+1}</strong></div></article><div class="editorial-pair"><section><h2>在旬中辨认位置</h2><p>{d.text}</p></section><section><h2>同一天，两种称呼</h2><p>旬日表示循环的位置，每日物象则指向年度中的具体条目。例如，本旬日可同时对应 <a class="text-link" href={`/days/${data.days[i].slug}/`}>{data.months[0].zh}{i+1}日的“{data.days[i].zh}” </a>。前者每十天重复，后者在一年的表中只占一个位置。</p></section></div><nav class="decade-links" aria-label="十个旬日名">{data.decades.map(v=><a href={`/decades/${v.slug}/`} aria-current={v.slug===d.slug?'page':undefined}>{v.zh}<span lang="fr">{v.fr}</span></a>)}</nav></div></Base>
